# ERROR EXAMPLE: Internal coordinate failure (linear bend problem)
# Allene (H2C=C=CH2) with near-linear CCC arrangement and slight asymmetric distortion
# During optimization the CCC angle approaches 180 degrees, causing redundant internal
# coordinates to become singular (linear bend undefined in standard internals)
# ORCA error: "Problem with internal coordinates" or "Redundant internal coordinates failed"
# Fix: Use Cartesian coordinates with %geom Constraints ... end or adjust coordinate system
! HF 6-31G(d) Opt Freq pal16

%maxcore 6000

* xyz 0 1
C      0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
C      1.310000    0.000000    0.000000
C      2.620000    0.000000    0.000000
H     -0.540000    0.930000    0.000000
H     -0.540000   -0.930000    0.000000
H      3.160000    0.000000    0.930000
H      3.160000    0.000000   -0.930000
*
